{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.072756767272949219,"h":0.016361448874322004,"c":1,"x":0.83504475337693329,"t":"Reading","y":0.11127511293567438},{"y":0.15210451603438124,"h":0.018705605056457131,"c":1,"x":0.17480919151199961,"t":"processing information, learning and memory. She also wanted to see if aging affects the density","w":0.72237269083658862},{"h":0.017378276312730367,"t":"of synaptic complexes within these structures—regions where neurons come together. Again, the","y":0.16838815766100568,"w":0.72238311767578134,"c":1,"x":0.1768784517422072},{"h":0.020738100696649053,"x":0.17477066655441234,"c":1,"t":"answer was no. What was more, the old ants didn't experience any drop in the levels of either","w":0.69779439290364575,"y":0.18267899112833907},{"x":0.17691289923926187,"h":0.016171221177064043,"y":0.1989704328464158,"c":1,"w":0.71203282674153645,"t":"serotonin or dopamine-brain chemicals whose decline often coincides with aging. In humans,"},{"x":0.17482232172957698,"y":0.21474645748722032,"w":0.57008936564127599,"h":0.018122103525977207,"c":1,"t":"for example, a decrease in serotonin has been linked to Alzheimer's disease."},{"h":0.015281823835608943,"y":0.24535499186349496,"c":1,"x":0.17691876636053194,"t":"ẠỊThis is the first time anyone has looked at both behavioral and neural changes in these ants so","w":0.70378377278645843},{"y":0.26148409913295489,"t":"thoroughly' says Giraldo, who recently published the findings in the Proceedings of the Royal","x":0.17489713086912853,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.7016460673014322,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Society B. Scientists have looked at some similar aspects in bees, but the results of recent bee","x":0.17686920121266761,"w":0.69564692179361987,"y":0.27625829157334381,"h":0.017617890635424183},{"y":0.29358068337614585,"c":1,"x":0.17695472299242054,"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.72839508056640623,"t":"studies were mixedsome studies showed age-related declines, which biologists call senescence,"},{"c":1,"x":0.17481588758859534,"y":0.30626985031547727,"h":0.018879894935059705,"t":"and others didn't. 'For now, the study raises more questions than it answers,' Giraldo says,","w":0.67299575805664058},{"w":0.39112648010253903,"t":"'including how P. dentata stays in such good shape?","h":0.017787291950275286,"c":1,"y":0.32263513584456849,"x":0.17484151466365727},{"c":1,"y":0.35453474697911624,"t":"Also, if the ants don't deteriorate with age, why do they die at all? Out in the wild, the ants","x":0.17695473966556391,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.67489710489908861},{"c":1,"h":0.018436953091930275,"x":0.17683648115908113,"w":0.64424540201822922,"y":0.36753056347002255,"t":"probably don't live for a full 140 days thanks to predators, disease and just being in an"},{"x":0.17901235360178305,"y":0.38515901085690596,"w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.01309680320910489,"c":1,"t":"environment that's much harsher than the comforts of the lab.iThe lucky ants that do live into old"},{"y":0.39958775027398685,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"t":"age may suffer a steep decline just before dying, Giraldo says, but she can't say for sure because","w":0.72016459147135414,"x":0.17695474129716074},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"her study wasn't designed to follow an ant's final moments.","y":0.41715116266940644,"c":1,"w":0.4423868306477865,"x":0.1769547326990345},{"x":0.18096706483524447,"y":0.44422797275651071,"h":0.018147212456477435,"c":1,"w":0.68330017089843753,"t":"It will be important to extend these findings to other species of social insects,' says Gene E."},{"h":0.015318242624595024,"t":"Robinson, an entomologist at the University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign. This ant might be","y":0.46187945478527537,"w":0.71409449259440094,"x":0.17896860367705444,"c":1},{"t":"unique, or it might represent a broader pattern among other social bugs with possible clues to the","x":0.17901233710024769,"c":1,"w":0.72222223917643236,"y":0.47819767428583293,"h":0.014534883982160629},{"x":0.17901233491251731,"w":0.62551442464192708,"c":1,"y":0.49411071847681431,"t":"science of aging in larger animals. Either way, it seems that for these ants, age really","h":0.013250883392226021},{"x":0.17901234490244425,"c":1,"w":0.1090534973144531,"t":"doesn't matter.","h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.51017441841147626},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"x":0.88271604948587612,"t":"83","y":0.86773255795657411}]}